text We scatter across the court.
text If this first pass gets stolen, it's game over.
text The other team knows that, so they're playing even harder defense than normal.
text The opposing formation switches around and around so quickly that I start to feel dizzy...
text I toss the ball inbounds.
text It reaches Yoshino Yusuke.
text He returns it to me before getting surrounded and committing another foul.
text I dribble the ball and cut through the center.
text The other team acts like they've been taken by surprise.
text It's because I haven't gone into the paint a single time until now.
text One, two...
text ...Layup!
text I see a shadow pass across my vision.
text I move the ball across my chest and into my left hand.
text Then, I leave the ball floating in the air, trusting that Sunohara is behind me.
